      "detail": "This export reports Fire 52%, Cold 56%, Lightning 17%, and Chaos -60%. The resistancePenalty setting is absent from the exported Config and actual Act is unknown, so the exact effective values need confirmation; even as shown, Lightning (1842 maximum hit) and Chaos (883 maximum hit) are especially concerning for HCSSF. Life is 1412.",
